hadiths[175]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1150","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man said to Abdullah ibn Abbas"
"1151","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man came to Abdullah ibn Masud and said"
"1152","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Abu Bakr ibn Hazm thatUmar ibn Abd al-Aziz had asked him what people said about the 'irrevocable' divorce"
"1153","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Marwan ibn al-Hakam decided that if someone made three pronouncements of divorce"
"1154","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab had heard in a letter from Iraq that a man said to his wife"
"1155","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Ali ibn Abi Talib used to say that if a man said to his wife"
"1156","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said that statements like ""I cut myself off from you"""
"1157","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad that a certain man had taken a slave-girl belonging to somebody else as a wife. He said to her people"
"1158","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard Ibn Shihab say that if a man said to his wife"
"1159","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man came to Abdullah ibn Umar"
"1160","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1161","Yahya related to me from Malik from Said ibn Sulayman ibn Zayd ibn Thabit that Kharija ibn Zayd ibn Thabit told him that he was sitting with Zayd ibn Thabit when Muhammad ibn Abi Atiq came to him with his eyes brimming with tears. Zayd asked him what the matter was. He said"
"1162","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim from his father that a man of Thaqif gave his wife command over herself"
"1163","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim from his father that A'isha"
"1164","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim from his father that A'isha"
"1165","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Umar and Abu Hurayra were asked about a man who gave his wife power over herself"
"1166","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1167","Yahya related to me from Malik from Jafar ibn Muhammad from his father that Ali ibn Abi Talib said"
"1168","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1169","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Said al-Musayyab and Abu Bakr ibn Abd ar-Rahman said about a man who made a vow to abstain from intercourse with his wife"
"1170","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Marwan ibn al-Hakam decided about a man who had made a vow to abstain from intercourse with his wife"
"1172","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had asked Ibn Shihab about the ila of the slave. He said that it was like the ila of the free man"
"1173","Yahya related to me from Malik from Said ibn Amr ibn Sulaym az- Zuraqi that he asked al-Qasim ibn Muhammad about a man who made divorce conditional on his marrying a woman i.e. if he married her he would automatically divorce her. Al-Qasim ibn Muhammad said"
"1174","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man asked al-Qasim ibn Muhammad and Sulayman ibn Yasar about a man who pronounced dhihar from his wife before he had married her. They said"
"1175","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said that a man who pronounced a dhihar from his four wives in one statement"
"1177","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that he heard a man ask Urwa ibn az-Zubayr about a man who said to his wife"
"1178","ahya related to me from Malik that he asked Ibn Shihab about the dhihar of a slave. He said"
"1179","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad that A'isha umm al-muminin"
"1180","ahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said that a female slave who was the wife of a slave and then was set free"
"1181","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr that a mawla of the tribe of Banu Adi called Zabra told him that she had been the wife of a slave when she was a slave-girl. Then she was set free and she sent a message to Hafsa"
"1182","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab said that if a man married a woman"
"1183","Malik said that if a slave-girl"
"1184","Yahya related. to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman told him from Habiba bint Sahl al-Ansari that she had been the wife of Thabit ibn Qays ibn Shammas. The Messenger of Allah"
"1185","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from a mawla of Safiyya bint Abi Ubayd that she gave all that she possessed to her husband as compensation for her divorce from him"
"1186","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Rubayyi bint Muawwidh ibn Afra came with her paternal uncle to Abdullah ibn Umar and told him that she had divorced her husband for a compensation in the time of Uthman ibn Affan"
"1187","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab and Sulayman ibn Yasar and Ibn Shihab all said that a woman who divorced for a compensation had the same idda as a divorced woman - three periods. Malik said that a woman who ransomed herself could not return to her husband except by a new marriage. If someone married her and then separated from her before he had intercourse with her"
"1188","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Sahl ibn Sad as-Saidi told him that Uwaymir al-Ajlani came to Asim ibn Adi al- Ansari and said to him"
"1189","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafic from Abdullah ibn Umar that a man cursed his wife in the time of the Messenger of Allah"
"1190","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that `Urwa ibn az-Zubayr said that if the child of the woman against whom li`an had been pronounced or the child of fornication"
"1192","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Thawban that Muhammad ibn Iyas ibn al-Bukayr said"
"1193","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Bukayr ibn Abdullah al-Ashajj from an-Numan ibn Abi Ayyash al Ansari from Ata ibn Yasar that a man came and asked Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As about a man who divorced his wife three times before he had had intercourse with her Ata said"
"1194","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Bukayr ibn Abdullah al-Ashajj informed him that Muawiya ibn Abi Ayyash al- Ansari told him that he was sitting with Abdullah ibn az-Zubayr and Asim ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab when Muhammad ibn Iyas ibn al-Bukayr came up to them and said"
"1195","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Talha ibn Abdullah ibn Awf said"
"1196","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn al-Fadl from al- Araj that Uthman ibn Affan made the wives of ibn Mukmil inherit from him"
"1197","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman say"
"1198","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban said"
"1199","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard Ibn Shihab say"
"1200","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abd ar- Rahman ibn Awf divorced his wife"
"1201","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1202","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"1204","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Sulayman ibn Yasar that Nufay"
"1205","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab that Nufay"
"1206","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdu Rabbih ibn Said from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith at-Taymi that Nufay"
"1207","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1208","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1209","Malik said"
"1210","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1211","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar divorced his wife while she was menstruating in the time of the Messenger of Allah"
"1212","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr from A'isha"
"1213","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said that he heard Abu Bakr ibn Abd ar-Rahman say"
"1214","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi and Zayd ibn Aslam from Sulayman ibn Yasar that al-Ahwas died in Syria when his wife had begun her third menstrual period after he had divorced her. Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan wrote and asked Zayd ibn Thabit about that. Zayd wrote to him"
"1215","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abu Bakr ibn Abd ar-Rahman and Sulayman ibn Yasar and Ibn Shihab used to say"
"1216","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1217","Yahya related to me from Malik from al-Fudayl ibn Abi Abdullah"
"1218","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab and Ibn Shihab and Sulayman ibn Yasar all said"
"1219","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard Ibn Shihab say"
"1220","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from a man of the Ansar that his wife asked him for a divorce"
"1221","Yahya related to me from Malik thal Yahya ibn Said heard al-Qasim ibn Muhammad and Sulayman ibn Yasar both mention that Yahya ibn Said ibn al-As divorced the daughter of Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Hakam irrevocably"
"1222","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that the daughter of Said ibn Zayd ibn Amr ibn Nufayl was the wife of Abdullah ibn Umar ibn Uthman ibn Affan"
"1223","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar divorced one of his wives in the house of Hafsa"
"1224","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab was asked who was obliged to pay the rent for a woman whose husband divorced her while she was in a leased house. Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1225","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Yazid"
"1226","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard Ibn Shihab say"
"1227","Malik said"
"1228","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1229","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Said ibn al- Musayyab said"
"1230","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Ali ibn Abi Talib said about the two arbiters about whom Allah"
"1231","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab"
"1232","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Masud said that there was nothing binding on someone who said"
"1233","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Said ibn al- Musayyab said"
"1234","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had asked Ibn Shihab about whether the deadline was set from the day he had married her"
"1235","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"1236","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said that he had heard Said ibn al-Musayyab"
"1237","Yahya related to me from Malik from Thabit ibn al-Ahnaf that he married an umm walad of Abd ar-Rahman ibn Zayd ibn al-Khattab. He said"
"1238","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Dinar said"
"1239","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said"
"1240","Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Allah"
"1241","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab and Sulayman ibn Yasar were asked about a man who divorced when he was drunk. They said"
"1242","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1243","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdu Rabbih ibn Said ibn Qays that Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman said that Abdullah ibn Abbas and Abu Hurayra were asked when a pregnant woman whose husband had died could remarry. Ibn Abbas said"
"1244","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar was asked about a woman whose husband died while she was pregnant"
"1245","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn 'Urwa from his father that al-Miswar ibn Makhrama told him that Subaya al-Aslamiya gave birth a few nights after the death of her husband. The Messenger of Allah"
"1246","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Sulayman ibn Yasar that Abdullah ibn Abbas and Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf differed on the question of a wornan who gave birth a few nights after the death of her husband. Abu Salama said"
"1247","Yahya related to me from Malik from Said ibn Ishaq ibn Kab ibn Ujra from his paternal aunt"
"1248","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd ibn Qays al-Makki from Amr ibn Shuayb from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Umar ibn al-Khattab sent back widows from the desert and prevented them from doing the hajj"
"1249","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Saqd that he had heard that as-Sa'ib ibn Khabbab died"
"1250","Yahya related to me from Malik that Hisham ibn Urwa said about a Bedouin woman whose husband died"
"1251","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullan ibn Umar said"
"1252","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that he had heard al-Qasim ibn Muhammad say that Zayd ibn Abd al-Malik separated some men and their wives who were slave-girls who had borne children to men who had died"
"1253","Malik related to me from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1254","Malik said"
"1255","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab and Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1256","Yahya related to me the like of that from Malik from Ibn Shihab. Malik said"
"1257","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban that Ibn Muhayriz said"
"1258","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'n-Nadr"
"1259","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'n-Nadr"
"1260","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar did not practise coitus interruptus and thought that it was disapproved"
"1261","Yahya related to me from Malik from Damra ibn Said al-Mazini from al-Hajjaj ibn Amr ibn Ghaziya that he was sitting with Zayd ibn Thabit when Ibn Fahd came to him. He was from the Yemen. He said"
"1262","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd ibn Qays al-Makki that a man called Dhafif said that Ibn Abbas was asked about coitus interruptus. He called a slave-girl of his and said"
"1263","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm from Humayd ibn Nafi that Zaynab bint Abi Salama related these three traditions to him. Zaynab said"
"1264","Zaynab said"
"1265","Zaynab said"
"1266","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Safiyya bint Abi Ubayd from A'isha and Hafsa"
"1267","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umm Salama"
"1268","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Salim ibn Abdullah and Sulayman ibn Yasar said that if a woman whose husband had died feared that an inflammation of her eyes might affect her sight or that some complaint might befall her"
"1269","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafic that Saffiyya bint Abi Ubayd suffered from an eye-complaint while she was in mourning for her husband"
"1270","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1271","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umm Salama"
"1272","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha"
"1273","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"1274","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr that A'isha umm al-muminin told him that Aflah"
"1275","Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"1276","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Amr ibn ash- Sharid that Abdullah ibn Abbas was asked whether"
"1277","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1278","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Salim ibn Abdullah ibn Umar informed him that A'isha umm al-muminin sent him away while he was being nursed to her sister Umm Kulthum bint Abi Bakr as-Siddiq and said"
"1279","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Safiyya bint Abi Ubayd told him that Hafsa"
"1280","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim that his father told him that A'isha"
"1281","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibrahim ibn Uqba asked Said ibn al-Musayyab about suckling. Said said"
"1282","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that he heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1283","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that he said"
"1284","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that he was asked about the suckling of an older person. He said"
"1285","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Dinar said"
"1286","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that a man said to Abu Musa al-Ashari"
"1287","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Sulayman ibn Yasar and from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr from A'isha umm al- muminin"
"1288","Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Nawfal said"
"1289","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazm from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha"
"1290","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source from Amr ibn Shuayb from his father from his father's father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1291","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1292","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm that Aban ibn Uthman and Hisham ibn Ismail used to mention in their khutbas built-in liability agreements in the sale of slaves"
"1293","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Salim ibn Abdullah that Abdullah ibn Umar sold one of his slaves for eight hundred dirhams with the stipulation that he was not responsible for defects. The person who bought the slave complained to Abdullah ibn Umar that the slave had a disease which he had not told him about. They argued and went to Uthman ibn Affan for a decision . The man said"
"1294","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud told him that Abdullah ibn Masud bought a slave-girl from his wife"
"1295","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar would say"
"1296","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Abdullah ibn Amir gave Uthman ibn Affan a slave-girl who had a husband whom he had purchased at Basra. Uthman said"
"1297","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf that Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf bought a slave- girl and found that she had a husband"
"1298","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1299","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1300","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd at-Tawil from Anas ibn Malik that the Messenger of Allah"
"1301","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'r-Rijal Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Haritha from his mother"
"1302","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Kharija ibn Zayd ibn Thabit that Zayd ibn Thabit did not sell fruit until the Pleiades were visible"
"1303","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar from Zayd ibn Thabit that the Messenger of Allah"
"1304","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn from Abu Sufyan"
"1305","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'r-Rijal Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman heard his mother"
"1306","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz decided in a case to make a reduction for crop damage. Malik said"
"1307","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abd ar-Rahman that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad would sell produce from his orchard and keep some of it aside"
"1308","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr that his grandfather"
"1309","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'r-Rijal"
"1310","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Ata ibn Yasar said"
"1311","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd al-Hamid ibn Suhayl ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf from Said ibn al-Musayyab from Abu Said al- Khudri and from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1312","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Yazid that Zayd ibn Ayyash told him that he had once asked Sad ibn Abi Waqqas about selling white wheat for a type of good barley. Sad asked him which was the better and when he told him the white wheat"
"1313","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1314","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn from Abu Sufyan"
"1315","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"1316","Malik said"
"1317","Yahya related to me from Malik from Musa ibn Abi Tamim from Abu'l Hubab Said ibn Yasar from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1318","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abu Said al-Khudri that the Messenger of Allah"
"1319","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd ibn Qays al-Makki that Mujahid said"
"1320","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard from his grandfather"
"1321","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan sold a gold or silver drinking- vessel for more than its weight. Abu'dDarda said"
"1322","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1323","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1324","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Oasim ibn Muhammad said"
"1325","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'z-Zinad heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1326","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1327","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Malik ibn Aus ibn al-Hadathan an-Nasri that one time he asked to exchange 100 dinars. He said"
"1328","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt saw Said ibn al-Musayyab sell gold counterpoising for gold. He poured his gold into one pan of the scales"